<title>UK: Halliburton declares OGC bid unconditional.</title>
<headline>Halliburton declares OGC bid unconditional.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. group Halliburton Co said on Wednesday its agreed 72.6 million stg bid for Scottish oilfield services firm OGC International Plc was now unconditional.</p>
<p>As of 1500 GMT, the company's Halliburton Holdings Ltd unit had valid acceptances for about 59.3 million OGC shares, representing some 97.4 percent of the company. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
